OL,3,GNEWSADouble murder investigation
OL,4,Alaunched over two deaths in Glasgow
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Supt Cheryl Kelly, of the force's
OL,7,FMajor Investigation Team, said: "It is
OL,8,Fvital we trace whoever is responsible
OL,9,Fand we are fully committed to doing
OL,10,Fthis."
